  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To find out the fraction of the money raised that will go to buy books, we need to multiply $\\frac{1}{2}$ by $\\frac{1}{3}.$\n\nWe multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1\\times 1}{2\\times 3}=\\frac{1}{6}\n$$\n\nSo,  $\\frac{1}{6}$ of the money raised will be used to buy books.",
